OL,3,GNEWSACall to honour journalists who
OL,4,Aresisted occupation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA permanent memorial is planned to
OL,7,FChannel Islands journalists who
OL,8,Fresisted Nazi occupation during World
OL,9,FWar Two.
OL,11,FThe journalists included Joseph
OL,12,FGillingham and Joseph Tierney who were
OL,13,Farrested, deported and died in prison
OL,14,Ffor sharing news heard on banned radios
OL,15,Fand Frank Falla, who survived
OL,16,Fimprisonment and whose book The Silent
OL,17,FWar tells how islanders challenged and
OL,18,Foutmaneuvered censorship.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
