OL,3,GNEWSACall to honour journalists who
OL,4,Aresisted occupation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe appeal by the Chartered Institute
OL,7,Fof Journalists for a plaque, in the
OL,8,Fjournalists' church St Bride's in Fleet
OL,9,FStreet London, has been led by
OL,10,Fhistorian Timothy Crook.
OL,12,FHe said a "memorial can contribute to
OL,13,Fthe restoration of a missing chapter of
OL,14,FBritish journalistic history".
